  partName: Rear Heat Shield
  description: The Rear Heat Shield is a tiny, elongated component located at the
    top-center-rear of the engine, protecting surrounding components from excessive
    heat generated by the engine. It is made of Material.001 and plays a crucial
    role in maintaining the engine's overall temperature. An interesting detail about
    the Rear Heat Shield is that its elongated shape allows it to cover a larger
    surface area, providing optimal heat protection.
